(text "PERFBOARD (70 x 50): screw terminals J1 (19 V in), J3 (motor), J6 (buck); pin headers J4 (display P3/P4), J5 (Hall) with Dupont housings." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b7d1f9f8-b182-5f6e-84c9-2e2933f0d9db"))
(text "Heavy wire (20-22 AWG): 19 V, GND, motor. C1 sits right at U1's VS and the GND next to it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 257.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c8f94e28-a6d5-5bf3-bbf9-3c5bb7786549"))
(text "U1 MS1 = MS2 = 3V3: 1/16 microstepping. CLK, TX, RX and DIAG unconnected. Set Vref ~0.7 V before connecting the motor." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 261.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b1100e03-a51d-5891-bf56-ca2d352fd10c"))
(text "R2 holds EN high (motor off) while the display's ESP32 boots - fit it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 265.43 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6798b2dd-9557-5011-8e75-24ea1c38add7"))
(text "Motor M1: 6-pin socket, pins 1+3 = coil A (red A1, blue A2); pins 4+6 = coil B (green B1, black B2); pins 2, 5 (centre taps) unused. J3 left to right: A2 A1 B1 B2." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "16af6828-47e8-5ecf-aa3b-b15989d10c13"))
(text "U3 (the JC4827W543R display's ESP32-S3) runs the motor: P3 + P4 pigtails -> J4. Powered by its USB from the Jetson - never also from the buck." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 273.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9628a692-4b50-5262-bc64-c4b4899a647d"))
(text "Hall U4 (A3144) on the motor bracket's pad: VCC from the 5 V buck, OUT pulled up to 3V3 by R1 (never to 5 V)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 276.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "552b4c68-70d0-5b61-944c-b907dc62cd10"))
